EXTRA = {
"seo-la-palma": ("A small-city checklist", "For a business in a city as small as La Palma, a few basics carry most of the weight. Make sure your Business Profile category is exactly right and every service is listed. Add your service area, naming La Palma and the nearby cities you truly serve. Upload real photos of your work or premises. Reply to every review. Publish one page per main service on your website, mentioning La Palma naturally. Check monthly that your hours and phone number are correct everywhere, including Apple Maps. These steps cost little time and make a small business look as complete as larger competitors in neighboring cities."),
"seo-los-alamitos": ("Making the most of visitors", "Events at the aquatic center bring teams and families from outside the area who need meals, lodging, physical therapy, supplies and quick services. Businesses that want this trade should keep hours and details current during event weekends, mention distance and directions from the aquatic center on their website, and make online ordering or booking easy on a phone. Reviews from visiting families help future visitors decide quickly."),
"seo-stanton": ("Standing out on Beach Boulevard", "Beach Boulevard runs through Stanton with many businesses side by side, so small differences matter in search. Use an accurate business name with no extra keywords, the most specific category, clear photos of your storefront and signage so customers recognize you, and exact parking and entrance details. Ask customers to mention Stanton and the service in reviews. These details help Google, Apple Maps and AI assistants match you to nearby searches rather than to a similar business in a neighboring city."),
"seo-cypress": ("Reaching students and residents together", "Cypress businesses near Cypress College serve two groups with different needs. Students look for quick, affordable options with late hours and online ordering; residents look for reliability, appointments and family services. Make both clear on your website and profile: hours, price ranges or student offers where you have them, and how to book. Separate pages for different audiences help Google and AI assistants match each search to the right information."),
"seo-laguna-hills": ("Preparing for Five Lagunas", "Large redevelopments change local search. As Five Lagunas brings new homes, shops and visitors, people will search for services nearby that didn't exist before. Businesses in Laguna Hills can prepare by keeping profiles complete, adding the neighborhood and nearby landmarks to their website, and asking new customers for reviews as they arrive. Being clearly described early makes it easier for new residents to find you through Google and AI assistants."),
"seo-laguna-woods": ("Writing for older readers and their families", "Pages for older adults and their families should be easy to read and act on. Use plain words and short paragraphs, a large readable font, high contrast, and a phone number that is easy to tap or see. Explain what happens at a first visit, how payment or insurance works and how family members can be involved. Avoid pop-ups and small links. These choices help readers, and they also make your information clearer for search engines and AI assistants."),
"seo-seal-beach": ("Reaching families who search for older relatives", "Adult children often search for services on behalf of parents in Seal Beach's retirement community. They want to know how you help, how visits are arranged, what it costs or how pricing works, and how they can stay informed. Answer these questions on a dedicated page, include a clear way for family members to contact you, and ask satisfied families for reviews. These details make you easier to recommend, by both search engines and AI assistants."),
}
